{"id": "43c8e476-292a-484b-9ab6-89203b63f1aa", "slug": "global-innovation-awards-2027", "title": "Global Innovation Awards 2027", "description": "Global Innovation UI Showcase Section is designed for demonstrating an application interface and hierarchy. Key features include dashboard-like visual hierarchy and dense but readable content organization. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for product showcases and interface-first landing experiences.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"Global Innovation Awards 2027\"\ndescription: \"Global Innovation UI Showcase Section is designed for demonstrating an application interface and hierarchy. Key features include dashboard-like visual hierarchy and dense but readable content organization. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for product showcases and interface-first landing experiences.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#000000\"\n  secondary: \"#0A0A0A\"\n  accent: \"#000000\"\n  background: \"#000000\"\n  surface: \"#A3A3A3\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#A3A3A3\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Playfair Display\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"8px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Global Innovation Awards 2027\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Meng To (@mengto). Views: 8; favorites: 3; remixes: 0.\nTags: dashboard, charts, bento, animated, webgl, effect.\n## Overview\nGlobal Innovation UI Showcase Section is designed for demonstrating an application interface and hierarchy. Key features include dashboard-like visual hierarchy and dense but readable content organization. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for product showcases and interface-first landing experiences.\n\nGlobal Innovation Awards 2027 Digital Product Alex Mercer Head of Product, Nexus Submissions open until 15 November 2027. nexusexperience.com\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Digital Product; Alex Mercer.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #000000, secondary #0A0A0A, accent #000000, background #000000, surface #A3A3A3, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Playfair Display for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nDashboard, chart, and data panels should preserve their compact operational hierarchy, nested surfaces, and metric emphasis.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\"><head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Global Innovation Awards 2027</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600&amp;family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;1,400&amp;display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n    <script>\n        tailwind.config = {\n            theme: {\n                extend: {\n                    fontFamily: {\n                        sans: ['Inter', 'sans-serif'],\n                        serif: ['Playfair Display', 'serif'],\n                    },\n                    colors: {\n                        'brand-black': '#0a0a0a',\n                        'brand-gray': '#a3a3a3',\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    </script>\n<link id=\"all-fonts-link-font-bricolage\" rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Bricolage+Grotesque:wght@300;400;500;600;700&amp;display=swap\"><style id=\"all-fonts-style-font-bricolage\">.font-bricolage { font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', sans-serif !important; }</style></head>\n<body class=\"bg-brand-black text-white font-sans min-h-screen overflow-x-hidden antialiased selection:bg-white selection:text-black\">\n\n    <!-- Canvas for WebGL-style Radial Animation -->\n    <canvas id=\"radial-canvas\" class=\"fixed inset-0 w-full h-full pointer-events-none z-0 opacity-40 md:opacity-100\" style=\"mix-blend-mode: screen;\"></canvas>\n\n    <!-- Main Content Layout -->\n    <main class=\"relative z-10 flex flex-col md:flex-row min-h-screen w-full max-w-[1600px] mx-auto\">\n\n        <!-- Left Column -->\n        <div class=\"w-full md:w-1/2 p-8 pt-12 md:p-16 lg:p-24 flex flex-col justify-between min-h-[100svh]\">\n\n            <!-- Header / Logo Area -->\n            <header class=\"flex items-start gap-4\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(-20px);\" id=\"header-anim\">\n                <!-- Abstract Geometric Logo -->\n                <div class=\"w-8 h-12 flex flex-col justify-between border-[1.5px] border-white p-1\">\n                    <div class=\"w-full h-[3px] bg-white\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"w-full h-full border-[1.5px] border-white my-1 flex items-start justify-end p-[2px]\">\n                        <div class=\"w-[40%] h-[40%] bg-white\"></div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"w-full h-[3px] bg-white\"></div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"text-xs tracking-[0.2em] text-gray-300 uppercase leading-relaxed mt-1 font-sans\">\n                    Global<br>\n                    Innovation<br>\n                    Awards<br>\n                    2027\n                </div>\n            </header>\n\n            <!-- Main Title (Masked Reveal) -->\n            <div class=\"mt-20 md:mt-32 mb-auto z-20\" id=\"title-container\">\n                <h1 class=\"text-5xl md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl font-serif tracking-tight leading-[1.1]\">\n                    <span style=\"display: block; overflow: hidden; padding-bottom: 0.1em;\">\n                        <span style=\"display: block; transform: translateY(110%);\" class=\"reveal-word tracking-tighter font-bricolage font-light\">Digital</span>\n                    </span>\n                    <span style=\"display: block; overflow: hidden; padding-bottom: 0.1em;\">\n                        <span style=\"display: block; transform: translateY(110%);\" class=\"reveal-word tracking-tighter font-bricolage font-light\">Product</span>\n                    </span>\n                </h1>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Profile Section -->\n            <div class=\"mt-16 md:absolute md:top-1/2 md:left-[35%] lg:left-[40%] md:-translate-x-1/2 md:-translate-y-[45%] flex flex-col items-center md:items-center z-20 w-full md:w-auto\" id=\"profile-anim\" style=\"opacity: 0;\">\n\n                <!-- Portrait with Subtle Gradient Border -->\n                <div class=\"rounded-full p-[1px] bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-300 via-gray-700 to-black shadow-2xl relative group cursor-pointer\" style=\"box-shadow: 0 20px 50px -10px rgba(0,0,0,0.7);\">\n                    <div class=\"rounded-full overflow-hidden bg-brand-black w-48 h-48 md:w-64 md:h-64 lg:w-72 lg:h-72 relative\">\n                        <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1584554376766-ac0f2c65e949?ixid=M3w3NTc5NzN8MHwxfHNlYXJjaHwxNHx8ZXhlY3V0aXZlJTIwcG9ydHJhaXR8ZW58MXwxfHx8MTc3NDAxNzk1M3ww&amp;ixlib=rb-4.1.0&amp;w=3840&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format&amp;q=80\" alt=\"Alex Mercer\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover grayscale opacity-90 transition-all duration-700 group-hover:scale-105 group-hover:grayscale-0 group-hover:opacity-100\" style=\"object-position: center 20%;\">\n                        <!-- Inner subtle shadow -->\n                        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 rounded-full shadow-[inset_0_0_40px_rgba(0,0,0,0.8)] pointer-events-none\"></div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"text-center mt-8\">\n                    <h2 class=\"text-2xl lg:text-3xl tracking-tighter font-bricolage font-light\">Alex Mercer</h2>\n                    <p class=\"text-brand-gray text-sm lg:text-base mt-1.5 font-light tracking-wide font-sans\">Head of Product, Nexus</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Footer area -->\n            <footer class=\"mt-24 md:mt-auto relative z-20\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\" id=\"footer-anim\">\n                <p class=\"text-brand-gray text-sm md:text-base font-light font-sans\">\n                    Submissions open until 15 November 2027.<br>\n                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-white hover:text-gray-300 transition-colors duration-300 relative inline-block after:content-[''] after:absolute after:w-full after:scale-x-0 after:h-[1px] after:bottom-0 after:left-0 after:bg-white after:origin-bottom-right after:transition-transform after:duration-300 hover:after:scale-x-100 hover:after:origin-bottom-left font-sans\">nexusexperience.com</a>\n                </p>\n            </footer>\n\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Right Column / Spacer for Canvas -->\n        <div class=\"hidden md:block w-1/2 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n    </main>\n\n    <script>\n        // --- WebGL-style Canvas Animation ---\n        const canvas = document.getElementById('radial-canvas');\n        const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');\n\n        let width, height, cx, cy;\n        let lines = [];\n        const numLines = 250;\n        let time = 0;\n\n        function resize() {\n            width = canvas.width = window.innerWidth;\n            height = canvas.height = window.innerHeight;\n            // Set focal point to the right edge, slightly above middle\n            cx = width;\n            cy = height * 0.45;\n            initLines();\n        }\n\n        function initLines() {\n            lines = [];\n            for (let i = 0; i < numLines; i++) {\n                // Distribute angles primarily towards the left hemisphere\n                const angle = (Math.PI / 2) + (Math.random() * Math.PI) - (Math.PI * 0.1);\n                const length = Math.random() * (width > 768 ? width * 1.2 : width * 1.5) + 100;\n\n                // Color variation: mostly white/gray, some subtle bronze/copper hints\n                const hue = Math.random() > 0.8 ? 30 : 0; // 30 is orange-ish\n                const sat = Math.random() > 0.8 ? '20%' : '0%';\n                const lit = Math.random() * 40 + 20; // 20% to 60% lightness\n                const alpha = Math.random() * 0.5 + 0.1;\n\n                lines.push({\n                    angle: angle,\n                    baseAngle: angle,\n                    length: length,\n                    color: `hsla(${hue}, ${sat}, ${lit}%, ${alpha})`,\n                    speed: (Math.random() - 0.5) * 0.0005,\n                    lineWidth: Math.random() > 0.9 ? 1.5 : 0.5\n                });\n            }\n        }\n\n        function draw() {\n            ctx.clearRect(0, 0, width, height);\n\n            // Subtle radial gradient originating from the focal point\n            const gradient = ctx.createRadialGradient(cx, cy, 0, cx, cy, width);\n            gradient.addColorStop(0, 'rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05)');\n            gradient.addColorStop(0.3, 'rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)');\n            ctx.fillStyle = gradient;\n            ctx.fillRect(0, 0, width, height);\n\n            time += 0.01;\n\n            lines.forEach((line, index) => {\n                // Slow organic rotation\n                line.angle = line.baseAngle + Math.sin(time + index * 0.1) * 0.02;\n\n                const endX = cx + Math.cos(line.angle) * line.length;\n                const endY = cy + Math.sin(line.angle) * line.length;\n\n                // Create individual line gradient to fade out\n                const lineGrad = ctx.createLinearGradient(cx, cy, endX, endY);\n                // Dense/bright near origin, fading to nothing\n                lineGrad.addColorStop(0, line.color.replace(/[\\d.]+\\)$/g, '0.8)'));\n                lineGrad.addColorStop(0.8, line.color);\n                lineGrad.addColorStop(1, 'rgba(0,0,0,0)');\n\n                ctx.beginPath();\n                ctx.moveTo(cx, cy);\n                ctx.lineTo(endX, endY);\n                ctx.strokeStyle = lineGrad;\n                ctx.lineWidth = line.lineWidth;\n                ctx.stroke();\n            });\n\n            requestAnimationFrame(draw);\n        }\n\n        window.addEventListener('resize', resize);\n        resize();\n        draw();\n\n\n        // --- GSAP Animations ---\n        gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n        window.addEventListener(\"load\", () => {\n            const tl = gsap.timeline();\n\n            // Header fade in\n            tl.to(\"#header-anim\", {\n                y: 0,\n                opacity: 1,\n                duration: 1,\n                ease: \"power3.out\"\n            });\n\n            // Masked staggered word reveal\n            tl.to(\".reveal-word\", {\n                y: \"0%\",\n                duration: 1.2,\n                stagger: 0.15,\n                ease: \"power4.out\"\n            }, \"-=0.5\");\n\n            // Profile fade in and scale\n            tl.to(\"#profile-anim\", {\n                opacity: 1,\n                duration: 1.5,\n                ease: \"power2.out\"\n            }, \"-=0.8\");\n\n            // Footer fade in\n            tl.to(\"#footer-anim\", {\n                y: 0,\n                opacity: 1,\n                duration: 1,\n                ease: \"power3.out\"\n            }, \"-=1\");\n\n            // Optional ScrollTrigger to re-trigger reveal if scrolled out of view (though it's a 100vh layout)\n            ScrollTrigger.create({\n                trigger: \"#title-container\",\n                start: \"top 80%\",\n                onEnter: () => {\n                    gsap.to(\".reveal-word\", {\n                        y: \"0%\",\n                        duration: 1.2,\n                        stagger: 0.15,\n                        ease: \"power4.out\",\n                        overwrite: \"auto\"\n                    });\n                }\n            });\n        });\n    </script>\n\n</body></html>", "preview_file_name": "global-innovation-awards-2027.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s-v3/global-innovation-awards-2027.jpg", "source_name": "global-innovation-awards-2027-DESIGN.md", "views": 87, "forks": 3, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "9109ecbb-cdc4-4815-981e-2ea83be13765", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T20:45:49.747314+00:00"}